      "beat_id": "BDEFS",
      "act": "DEFINITIONS",
      "lane": "CARD",
      "narration_text": "Five words before we start. CLAUDE.md: constraints — what Claude may and may not do in this folder, read at the start of every session. DESIGN.md: every aesthetic decision named — colour, type, layout, interaction, and what silence means. PROJECT.md: the intent layer — who it is for, what they should feel, what it refuses, what done means, and what is out of scope. Definition of done: a check you can run; here, a script that prints pass or fail. Autoplay: any animation that runs by itself — set-interval, set-timeout, or an animation-frame loop.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 33.3,
      "voice": "am_onyx",
