      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "THE THREE FILES",
      "lane": "SHELL",
      "narration_text": "Three files, written by the teacher, before the second run. CLAUDE.md: one file, vanilla JS, no framework, no external requests, and run check.py before you say done. DESIGN.md: two colours for the bars, one accent for the button, one cream page, one font — and no legend, no dropdown, no explainer text. PROJECT.md: the five questions only the teacher can answer. Who is this for. What should they feel. What does this refuse. What is done. What is out of scope. Nineteen lines. The lesson plan, made durable.",
